UnitStakedGEOToken::constants
└── when deployed
    └── it sets _STAKED_GEO_TOKEN_STORAGE_LOCATION to keccak256(abi.encode(uint256(keccak256("geo.storage.StakedGEOToken")) - 1)) & ~bytes32(uint256(0xff))

UnitStakedGEOToken::constructor
└── when called
    └── it disables initializers

UnitStakedGEOToken::initialize
├── when passing valid parameters
│   ├── it sets the owner
│   ├── it sets stakingManager
│   ├── it sets the token name
│   └── it sets the token symbol
├── when called twice
│   └── it reverts with InvalidInitialization
├── when stakingManager is zero
│   └── it reverts with InvalidAddress
└── when council is zero
    └── it reverts with OwnableInvalidOwner

UnitStakedGEOToken::clock
└── when called
    └── it returns block.timestamp

UnitStakedGEOToken::CLOCK_MODE
└── when called
    └── it returns mode=timestamp

UnitStakedGEOToken::mint
├── when called by stakingManager
│   ├── it updates balanceOf
│   └── it updates getVotes
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount
└── when caller is not stakingManager
    └── it reverts with OnlyStakingManager

UnitStakedGEOToken::burn
├── when called by stakingManager
│   ├── it updates balanceOf
│   └── it updates getVotes
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount
└── when caller is not stakingManager
    └── it reverts with OnlyStakingManager

UnitStakedGEOToken::transfer
└── when called
    └── it reverts with SoulboundTransfer

UnitStakedGEOToken::transferFrom
└── when called
    └── it reverts with SoulboundTransfer

UnitStakedGEOToken::delegate
└── when called
    └── it reverts with DelegationDisabled

UnitStakedGEOToken::delegateBySig
└── when called
    └── it reverts with DelegationDisabled

UnitStakedGEOToken::getPastVotes
├── when staked
│   └── it returns the minted balance
└── when partially burned
    └── it returns the reduced balance

UnitStakedGEOToken::getStakeEligibleSince
├── when never staked
│   └── it returns zero
├── when staked
│   └── it returns the stake timestamp
├── when partially burned
│   └── it returns the original stake timestamp
├── when fully burned
│   └── it returns zero
├── when restaked
│   └── it returns the restake timestamp
└── when topped up
    └── it returns the first stake timestamp

UnitStakedGEOToken::getPastStakeEligibleSince
├── when never staked
│   └── it returns zero
├── when staked before query timestamp
│   └── it returns the stake timestamp
├── when staked after query timestamp
│   └── it returns zero
├── when partially burned
│   └── it returns the original stake timestamp
├── when fully burned
│   └── it returns zero
├── when restaked
│   └── it returns the restake timestamp
├── when topped up before query timestamp
│   └── it returns the first stake timestamp
└── when topped up after query timestamp
    └── it returns the first stake timestamp

UnitStakedGEOToken::typeId
└── when called
    └── it returns the type

UnitStakedGEOToken::version
└── when called
    └── it returns semantic version

UnitStakedGEOToken::_authorizeUpgrade
├── when called by owner
│   └── it authorizes the upgrade
└── when called by non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
